"Emilija is an F-rank Rabbit whose skill fixes chipped paint; she is Natalie Choir's roommate."
"She has dark hair in a ponytail, fears being summoned, and fears stalkers."
"She feels other classes laugh at her."
"She lives on a stipend and will join Natalie in Apex if the rent is affordable."
"She attends Franklin High, since F-ranks can't apply to CNH, and calls Alden the thief."
"She is Lithuanian and means to live her whole life on Anesidora."
"In the Matadero flood her teleport timer vanished amid the Bunker Street shelter riot."
"Boosted by Lute's chains, she tackled rioters with sudden speed, breaking a man's arm."
